infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Two sides of the hexagon
  desc Driving side (left) calls the app via a primary port; driven side (right) is called by the app via a secondary port
  compares
    - label Driving side (left/primary)
      children
        - label Driving: actor initiates
          desc The adapter calls the application
        - label HTTP, CLI, Kafka, test
          desc Every entry point is a driving adapter
        - label Calls a primary port
          desc Domain-owned public contract
        - label Input format to port call
          desc Request fields become method arguments
        - label Source dep points inward
          desc Adapter imports the domain's interface
    - label Driven side (right/secondary)
      children
        - label Driven: app initiates
          desc The application calls the adapter
        - label Postgres, Stripe, SendGrid, S3
          desc Every outbound dependency is a driven adapter
        - label Implements a secondary port
          desc Domain-owned required capability
        - label Port call to infra call
          desc Method arguments become an SDK or SQL call
        - label Source dep points inward
          desc Adapter implements the domain's interface
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6
